<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malombolezo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Malombolezo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malombolezo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="iot">Chitabu cha Malombolezo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ni chitabu cha nchemo kulanga ubanasi mo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Mta kuwandika we ichitabu cha Malombolezo hakwelavyanya, mna wata kuwandika watuhu wa chikale wa Chiyahudi na wantu wakulisito wazumila kugamba muwoni Yelemiya nuyo awandike. Kwaviya chitabu icho chalanga kubogozolwa ko mzi wa Yelusalemu, vyadahika chawandikagwa wize ujinke umhilimo wa 586 Kulisito henati kwelekwa, umo umzi wa Yelusalemu ubogozolwe, mna hewinati mhilimo wa 516 Kulisito henati kwelekwa wize uzengwe uhya ne Inyumba ya Chohile kukukizwa. Chitabu chino vyadahika chawandikagwa ni mntu ekalaga hajihi ne chipindi cho kubogozolwa ko mzi mhilimo wa 586 Kulisito henati kwelekwa. Chitabu chose cha Malombolezo chalagisa chinyulu cha wantu wo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Hata hegu mzi wa Yelusalemu wabogozolagwa ni bunga dya wagomba nkondo wa Babeli diwebungile, mta kuwandika we chitabu chino cha Malombolezo awandika kugamba vilaila kwaviya Chohile nakawakantila wantu we isi ya Yuda mwe sula ya 1:12. Chohile kawakantila wantu wa Yuda kujinkila wantu wa Babeli awo wayebungile isi yawo. Mtakuwandika we chitabu chino achei akumbuka ukanuni wa Chohile. Kwa chinyulu chakwe mta kuwandika atambalisa, “Ungi wa Zumbe Chohile hewine udumo na mbazi na mbazi za Chohile zakwe vichei vyajendeleza mazuwa yose.” Mwe sula ya 3:22. Vikaheza mta kuwandika we chitabu chino abindiliza kwa malombezo kwa Chohile kuizenga uhya isi ya Yuda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani mwe Chitabu cha Malombolezo.</para>
  <para style="io">1. Mtakuwandika atambalisa chinyulu kwa nkanto ya Chohile mwa awantu wakwe na ubanasi wo mzi wa Yelusalemu, mwe sula ya 1 na 2.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Mta kuwandika akumbuka ukanuni wa Chohile vyaleka alombeza wambizi mwe sula ya 3.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Yajendeleza vituhu chinyulu kwa masulumizo yehiye ya wantu wa Yuda mwe sula ya 4.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Malombezo kwa Chohile avuze isi ya wantu wa Yuda, sula ya 5.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Chinyulu cha wantu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Kaula mzi wendile umema wantu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">mna haluse usigala wibule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Wendaga umanyikisa mgati mwe izisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">vino haluse usigala saviya mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Mgati mwe imizi wendaga saviya mchiche ywa seuta, haluse katenda mtumwa.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Nechilo ailisa kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">mesozi yaguluka mwe zifunda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Hahana hata yumwenga ywa kumhoza mwe vyendegwa vyakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Wambuyaze wose wamhituka naho watenda wankondo wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Wantu wa Yuda wegalwa ko samizo kwa masulumizo yatendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Vino haluse wekala mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu, naho hawakupata hantu ha kwika ntulwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Wose nawakamlonda wamgwila mwe zinkunto zakwe, hana kwekusumkila.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Izisila zo kwitila Sayuni zalomboleza, kwaviya hakuna akwiza kwe ngasu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Haluse hahana mntu akwiza kuvika kwe Inyumba ya Chohile, walavyantambiko wakwe waila kwa usungu, wachiche wakwe wamema chinyulu, umzi wenye wi mwenkunto.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Wankondo wakwe nawo wakulongoza naho wachumilwa, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kausulumiza kwachausa cho ubanasi utendese. Wanawe watahigwa na kwigalwa hale.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Ntogozi yose ya wantu wa Sayuni yusika, masekulu wakwe wose watenda saviya kapala kasokezwe ni sala. Wakajenda kwa usokezi, wawasumka wadya wakuwacheseka.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Mwa mazuwa ya masulumizo na kwangadika, wantu wo mzi wa Yelusalemu wakumbuka ntogozi zakwe ze chikale. Umo wantu wakwe wagwilagwa ni wankondo wakwe, hakwendaga na ywa kuwambiza. Wadya wawahudile wakalaula na kwesekeza ukuhudwa kwawo.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Wantu wa Yelusalemu wakola masa yehise, elo watenda wavu mwe sila yo kumvikila Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Wose nawakawatunya vino haluse wawambela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">kwaviya wawona isoni yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Wantu momzi wasulumila na kugubika nyuso zawo kwaviya wawona soni.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Masa yawo yatendesa, hawafanyanye mwe mbuli zo wikazi wawo ukwiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Ukugwa kwakwe nendile ni kwa kwehela, hahana mntu yoyose akudaha kumhoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Wantu wa Yelusalemu wamwitanga Zumbe Chohile, kaula idisulumizo dyangu, kwaviya mnkondo ywangu kanihuda.<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Wankondo wakwe wamhoka izihazina zakwe zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">Awona wantu sawo Wayahudi wakengila mwe Inyumba ya Chohile, wantu awo walemezwe ni Zumbe Chohile kwehanga hamwenga na wantu wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Wantu wa Yelusalemu wose wangadika wakalonda nkande, walavya ugoli wawo vileke wapate nkande wajendeleze kutenda wajima. “Zumbe Chohile, nikaula mwe zinkunto zangu, wantu mo mzi waila.” Zumbe Chohile kaula ivyo wantu wakunibela.<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />“Vino hamkwituka chintu, nyuwe wajinka sila? Kaulani muwone! Hahana apatigwe nu usungu saviya miye, usungu aniletele Zumbe Chohile, mwe zuwa dya maya yakwe yatendese.”<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />Nakatuma moto kulawa kulanga. Umoto niyo wanoka mwamafuha yangu. Kanitegela lwavu na kunigwiza na kunivuza kunyuma. Vikaheza niyo anasa hatenda mchiwa msi wose.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />“Masa yangu yose kayawona na kuyataliza hamwenga, kayanemeza mwe singo yangu, masa ayo yanihosa niswese nguvu, Zumbe Chohile kanitenda nihudwe ni wankondo sikudaha kuhigana nawo.”<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />“Zumbe Chohile kawabela wagomba nkondo wangu wose wata nguvu, kasigila bunga dya wagomba nkondo dikome wabwanga na wandele wangu. Zumbe kawajata wantu wangu wa Yuda saviya mntu akujata zabibu hantu ha kufumbwila divai.”<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />“Ivyo nivyo vikuleka miye naila, mesozi yajuluzika, hahana ywa kunijela moyo, sina mntu yoyose ywa kunihoza. Wanangu wasigwa wachiwa, kwaviya mnkondo ywangu kanihuda.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Nachulusa mikono yangu, mna hahana mntu akudaha kunambiza Zumbe Chohile wawetanga wankondo wangu kulawa ntendele zose, Waniwona ni saviya chintu chihise.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />Zumbe Chohile adamanya viya vikuwagila, hata ivyo miye sitimile imiko yakwe. Netegelezani, nyuwe wantu wose, kaulani masulumizo yangu. Wandele wangu na wabwanga wangu watahigwa na kwigalwa ko usamizo.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Nasiwetanga wambuya zangu wanambize mna walemela. Vilongozi na walavyantambiko wabanika mwezinkwikwi zo mzi, wakalonda nkande chani wekale no ujima.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, kaula ivyo hwangadika, moyo wangu wangadika kwaviya sikuhituka vitendese. Uko kuse wantu wakomwa kwa mabamba, mnyumba namo ni file du.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Chila yumwenga keva ivyo hwila ko usungu, mna hahana mntu ywa kunihoza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Wankondo wangu welelwa kugamba kunigwisiza file. Zuwa diya walongaga nodilete, dilete, chani wankondo wangu wasulumile saviya miye.”<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />“Wakantile kwa wavu wawo wose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Watende saviya unitendile miye kwachausa cha masa yangu yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Nailisa kwa usungu, umoyo wangu ususuhala.”<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile awakantila wantu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Kwa maya yakwe Zumbe Chohile kawasa wantu wa Sayuni wengile soni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Ntogozi ya Izulaeli kaigwisa hasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Mwe idizuwa dya maya yakwe hata Inyumba yakwe kayasa.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />Zumbe Chohile kabalanga wikazi wose wa welekwa wa Yakobo hena mbazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Mo ukwihiwa kwakwe kazibogozola ngome za wantu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Useuta wawo ne vilongozi wakwe kawajela soni.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Inguvu yose ya Izulaeli kaivuna chimayamaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Kaleka kuwambiza wantu wa Izulaeli umo wadugane na wankondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Katenda mkali saviya moto mwa wantu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">kalemela kuchambiza.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Kachionyekeza misale yakwe saviya mnkondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Wakankalu wose nachikefenyeza kawakoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Amaya yakwe yatendese yachimukila enga moto ukwaka muno mo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Zumbe Chohile katenda enga mnkondo, kawakoma Waizulaeli, kabogozola amazumba yose, ngome zakwe kazibogozola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Wantu wa Yuda kawajenyezeza matanga na malombolezo.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Inyumba yakwe umo chikuvikila kaibogozola enga abogozola heha kwe konde, wikazi wakwe kaubalanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">Kayusa ingasu ye Idizuwa dyo kuhumula uko Sayuni, kwa maya yakwe yatendese kawalemela maseuta na walavyantambiko.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />Zumbe Chohile kailemela imazabahu yakwe na kuilemela Inyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Kwaleka wankondo wabogozole viwambaza vya mazumba ye chiseuta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Watula lwasu mndani mwe Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, enga chizumo mwe zuwa dya ngasu.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />Zumbe Chohile kekamba abogozole ichiwambaza cho umzi wa Sayuni, kauhima niyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">akombaganya kugamba chila chintu chabogozolwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">Vilingo na viwambaza vya kuse vyo umzi wa Yelusalemu kavitenda zibule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">vyose vibogozolwe chalumwe.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Izinyivi zawo zididimila mwe sanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">mihindo ya chuma kaibalanga na kuivuna vuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Seuta na masekulu wegelwa ko usamizo mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Sigilizi haikutimilwa vituhu, wawoni wakwe hawakupata naho uwoni kulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Wadalahala wa Yelusalemu wekala hasi kuno wanyamala, wejela malumbi mwe mitwi yawo kuno wavala suche za majuniya walagisa kugamba wana chinyulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Wandele wa Yelusalemu wafunamila hasi.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />Meso yangu yavimba kwa kwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">iloho yangu imema usungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Umoyo wangu una chinyulu chitendese kwaviya wantu wangu wakomwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Wana wadodo na watiti wabanika mwe zinkwikwi zo umzi kwaviya waswesa nkande.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Wawauza wamami zawo, “Nkande ikuhi, chakunywa chikuhi?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">Wafa chifimbazi mwe zisila zo umzi saviya wantu walumizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">wabanikila mwe mikono ya wamami zawo.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Hugambile mbwani weye Yelusalemu? Huliganye na mbwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Nadaha huhoze na mbwani weye mchiche ywa Sayuni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Nkomano zako ni ntali enga mzumilizo wa bahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Ni yuhi akudaha kukuhonya?<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />Wawoni wako wakuwonela uwoni wo udanti, hawabunkule pwilili masa yako, vileke wadahe kukuliganya, mna wakuwonela milosi yo danti ikwazaganya.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Wantu wose wakujinka sila wakutila na kukubela weye Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">Wakutila na kusingisa mitwi yawo mwako weye mhiche ywa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">wagamba, “Togolani, uno yudya umzi naukatogoleswa kujinka mizi yose kwa utana mwe izisi zose?”<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />Wankondo wako wose wakuzoma, wakujela mishu wasila meno yawo wakalonga vihiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">wagamba, “Chimwajika! Dino nidyo idizuwa nachikajelejeza dibule, haluse chidiwona!”<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />Zumbe Chohile kadamanya yadya aungile achidamanyize, saviya alagize kukongela chikale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">kachikoma hehena mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">kawatenda wankondo wetu welelwe mwe nkanto yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">kawenula wakankalu wa awankondo wetu.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />We mzi wa Yelusalemu, wantu wako wamwilile Zumbe Chohile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Mesozi yajuluzike saviya mto chilo na msi, Ila na kulomboleza usekuhumula!<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Inuka nechilo wile chilo chijima. Mgambile Zumbe Chohile yadya ye mo umoyo mwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">Mchulusize imikono yako uwalombezeze wanawo wakugwa mteho hohose mwe zisila.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Zumbe Chohile kaula! Togola hana yoyose umtendele savino uchitendele suwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Hata wavyele wadye wana wawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Togola wawoni na walavyantambiko wakomelwe mwe Inyumba yako?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Vimba vya wabwanga na wadalahala vilambala mwe malumbi mwe sila nkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">wabwanga wangu na wandele wagwa wakomwa kwe nkondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">kuwakoma zuwa dya amaya yako, kuwakoma hehena mbazi.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Wankondo wangu kuwagoneka saviya mwe ngasu, singilwa ni nkama ntendele zose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Zumbe Chohile mwe dizuwa dya maya yako hahana asumkaga hegu kuhona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Wanangu neleke na kulela wakomwa ni wankondo wangu.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Nkanto na kweila na msuhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Miye ni mntu nisulumizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:1">Chohile kanikantila kwaviya kanimukila maya.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Kaniguha na kunigala kwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:2">hekwine ulangazi.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Kanikantila nkanana zilozize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:3">kanijela mwe nkunto msi mjima.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Chohile kahosa nkanda yangu ikugutala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:4">mavuha yangu kayatula.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Kanebunge na kunizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:5">kwa usungu na masulumizo.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Kanitenda nikale mwe chiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:6">sawadya wabanikaga chikale.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Kanizugulusiza chiwambaza chani nisekudaha kusumka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:7">kaninyinya minyolo izamile.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />Netanga kwa izwi halombeza wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:8">mna Chohile hakunga kuhokela lombezo dyangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Sila zangu kazifunta mayuwe makulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:9">wavumu wangu hawakujinkika.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Ivyo eli mwangu ni saviya dubu dikuninyatila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:10">enga simba ikunigoje inebunge.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Kanikwesa mwe sila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:11">niyo anitatavula na kunasa sine wambizi.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Kakwesa uta wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:12">kanitenda tailo dya misale yakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Kanilasa mo umoyo kwa misale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:13">alavize mwe dinzaka dyakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Miye sitenda mntu ywa kutilwa ni chila mntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:14">msi mjima wachema wakanizoma.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Wikazi wangu kaumemeza nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:15">saviya mntu akunywa chintu chisungu dwaa.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Masulumizo ayo ni saviya mntu abubute mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:16">kanibuluga mwe maivu.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />Wikazi wetu wo utondowazi usigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:17">chijala kuchumilwa ni mbwani.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Niyo nafanyanya nafa chefu vitendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:18">vyose nikiye msuhi kwa Zumbe Chohile vyusika.<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />Hakumbuka nkunto zangu no kwangadika kwangu, nawona usungu saviya sungwi.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Mazuwa yose nafanyanya mbuli izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:20">miye simema chinyulu mo umoyo.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Nekumbusa mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:21">ivyo nichei na msuhi.<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />Kwachausa cha ungi mkulu wa Zumbe Chohile hewine uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:22">mbazi zakwe hazina udumo.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />Chila kukacha ni mpya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:23">ukanuni wakwe ukulisa.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Zumbe Chohile nuyo akuninka chila chintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:24">elo msuhi wangu naika mwakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />Zumbe Chohile ni ywedi kwa chila mntu akumwikiya msuhi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:25">ni mkanuni kwa wose wakumwiva.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Ni vyedi mntu kugoja kwa kujijimiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:26">ukombolwa ukulawa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Ni vyedi mntu kuhina kujijimiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:27">kukongela ubwanga wakwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />Nvi vyedi mntu ekale mwenye ichedu na kunyamala dwii, kwaviya masulumizo yakumbwila yalawa kwa Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Ongigwa afuname na kunyanyahala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:29">vyadahika msuhi wichei.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Amwonyekeze yudya akumtowa ifunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:30">emalaye kuhokela mahuluto.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Zumbe Chohile ni mta mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:31">hakudaha kuchilemela kale na kale.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />Hata hegu achiletela chinyulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:32">nachilagise mbazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:32">kwaviya ungi wakwe hauna udumo.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Uyo hakubweda kuwasulumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:33">hegu kuwatenda wantu wengile chinyulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Zumbe Chohile kamanya ivyo wantu wehiye wakuwabunyana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:34">wose wekwechifungo.<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />Kwazaganya nkanto ya mntu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:35">kulongozi kwa Chohile Mkulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />Uneva ulahi wahitulaganywa mwe ichitala kavimanya.<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Ni yuhi akudaha kulagiza chintu chidamanyike, uneva Zumbe Chohile halagize?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Mbuli zedi na mbuli zihiye vyose vyalaila du kwa lagizo dya Zumbe Chohile Mkulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Kwambwani mntu afuzuma, akakantilwa kwachausa cha masa yakwe?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Nachihime na kukaula imijendele yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:40">chani chidahe kumuwiya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Chinule imyoyo hamwenga ne imikono yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:41">kulanga kwa Chohile chimlombeze, chigambe,<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />“Zumbe Chohile, chidamanya masa na kukuhituka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:42">weye uchei huchilekeile.<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />Kwegubika mwenye kwa maya na kuchibasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:43">kuchikoma hehena mbazi.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Kwegubika kwa ingu dizamile, chani malombezo yetu yasekukubwila uko wili.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />Kuchitenda zalazala dya ntaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:45">mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />Wankondo wetu wose wachizoma na kuchihuluta.<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />Chisulumizwa ni woga utendese na nkunto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:47">chipatwa ni file na ubanasi.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />Meso yangu yajuluzika saviya kakolongo ka mesozi kwachausa cha kukomwa wantu wangu.”<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />“Mesozi yanilawa hehena udumo,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />kubula Zumbe Chohile asinye hasi kulawa kwe mbingu na kuchiwona achambize.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Miye naila na kumema mesozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:51">hawona yawapatile wavyele wo umzi wangu.”<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />“Wose wendile wankondo wangu, wanongola enga kadege hehena luhosa.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Wanidula mwe bome nichei mjima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:53">na kunichisanyiza mayuwe.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Mazi nayakonga kunigubika umtwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:54">sifanyanya file yangu ihajihi.<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Kulawa hasi kwe dibome,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:55">sikwilila weye Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Weye kwiva lombezo dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:56">usekuleka kuniva ndilo yangu halombeza wambizi.<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Nize hwitange niyo wasogela hajihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:57">na kunigamba nisekogoha.<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, weye kunigombela mwe nkunto zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:58">kukombola ujima wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, kuwona kubunyanywa kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:59">nilamwila ulahi wangu kwa wedi.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Weye kuvimanya ivyo wankondo wangu wakunihiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:60">ne myalo yawo ihiye mwangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />Zumbe Chohile, kuyeva amahuluto yawo wakunihulita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:61">ne myalo yawo yose ihiye mwangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />Msi mjima wankondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:62">milosi ne izifanyanyi zawo<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Wakaule! Wakekala hegu wakajenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:63">wanitila mwe zinchemo zawo.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />Weye Zumbe Chohile, wakantile kuligana na ntendwa zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:64">kuligana ne izimbuli wadamanye wenye.<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Waligite na kuwatenda wasulumile!<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />Umo ukatenda kumema maya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:66">wabalaze na kuwakoma wasile pele muno mwe isi!”<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu kanto yako ichinta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Zahabu yetu naikamweka, haluse ivuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">zahabu yendile ntana haluse haikumweka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">Mayuwe ya yombe kulu kulawa mwe Inyumba ya Chohile yamwaganiswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">niyo yamwaganika mwe isila yose.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Wabwanga wa Sayuni wendaga wakatogoleswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">nawakaungwa uge zahabu ntana mna haluse watenda enga chilongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">ndima idamanywe ni mufi.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Hata uzi dyenkiza matombo dyonkeza wanawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">mna wantu wangu ni manyakwili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">wadamanya saviya mbuguni ikudula wanawe.<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Milomo ya watiti wawo ikaluka nchilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">wana walombeza nkande mna hahana mntu ywa kuwenka.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Wantu na wakadya nkande zinonile haluse wafa sala mwesila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">waleligwe na kuvalwa chiseuta vino haluse wagona mwa maivu.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />Wantu wangu wenkigwa nkato nkulu kujinka ya wantu wa Sodoma, mzi utikimywe chipumpa hehena wambizi wowose.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Wakulu wa Sayuni wendaga watana saviya balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">wendaga wang'ala uge mele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">Imili yawo yendaga ijimbala naho itoga.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Vino haluse sula zawo zititu kujinka mkaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">wakajinka mwe sila hawakumanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">nkanda zawo zimamatilana na mavuha yawo yanyala uge nkuni.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Wakomigwe kwe nkondo wana lwedilwedi ukaleka wakufa sala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">na wakulahila sala kubula wabanika.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Wavyele watendaga na mbazi zitendese, wawambikaga wana wawo wenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">wawahitusa nkande yawo, umo wantu wangu wakakomwa ni wankondo.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />Zumbe Chohile kachintiza nkanto yakwe kwa maya yakwe yatendese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">kaseleza maya yakwe yatendese, katimpa moto komzi wa Sayuni uwo utikimya amazumba ne vyegamo vyakwe.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Masekulu mwe si hawakombaganye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">hegu wekazi wose mwe izisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">kugamba mta kwebunga hegu mnkondo adaha kwingila mwe izinchili za Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Zumbe Chohile kawakantila wantu wa Yelusalemu, mbuli izo zilaila kwachausa cha masa ya wawoni wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">na wavu wa walavyantambiko wakwe, awo wakomile wantu wedi mo umzi wawo.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Vilongozi wawo wajenda wakangadika mwesila enga matuntu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">wavavagala sakame mwe zisuche zawo vyatenda hahana mntu akuwakufya.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Wantu wawatwila lwasu wakagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">“Halaweni nyuwe mwi wazavu naho hamkuzumilika!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Msekukufya chintu chochose!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Elo, niyo wangadika kulawa si kwita si ntuhu, wantu we izisi izo wawagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">“Hachikunga wajeni muno mwetu.”<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />Zumbe Chohile mwenye kawatimulaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">naho hakuwatolotoza vituhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">Walavyantambiko na vilongozi hawatunywe vituhu.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Nachisokela kudundumala ntongo meso kugoja wambizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">chicheleza na kugoja kwa nkwina wantu we si hewekudaha kuchambula.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Wankondo wetu watitimila nkacho zetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">niyo chadunduga kujenda mwe zisila zetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">Mazuwa yetu nayachinta, udumo wetu ubula.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Wakuchibalaza wahuha kujinka magushu mo ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">wachibalaza kwa magulu, wachinyatila kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />Wamgwiza yudya chikiye msuhi wo ujima wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">yudya seuta asagulwe kwa kuhakwa mavuta ni Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">yudya chazumile kugamba nachidime na kwikala mpeho mgati mwa wantu we izisi ntuhu.<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />Wekazi wa Edomu, vino haluse mwadaha mtende na chinyemi, mwadaha kwelelwa vino haluse nyuwe wekazi wa Uzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">Mna chikombe chino che nkanto iviya nachiwabwileni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">na kukolwa na kujela soni.<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Weye mchiche ywa Sayuni, nkanto yako ichinta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Zumbe Chohile hawaseni mjendele kwikala ko usamizo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Mna nyuwe wantu wa Edomunawakantileni kwa chausa cha masa yenyu na kulagisa pwilili uwavu wenyu.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kulombeza mbazi kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Weye Zumbe Chohile Kumbuka izimbuli zichipatile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:1">Chikaule ivyo chijeligwe soni.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Isi yetu iguhigwa ni wajeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">ne izinyumba zetu zekalwa ni wantu wa si ntuhu.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Watati zetu wakomwa ni wankondo, wamnala watenda wasigwa.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Mazi chikunywa chata kugula, nkuni zetu chatagilwa.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Chakunduganywa chidamanye ndima saviya mpunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">hata hegu chisokela hachikungwa chikahema.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Chelavya kwa wantu wa Misili na wantu wa Ashulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">chani chipate nkande ikuchinta.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Wababa zetu wadamanyaga masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">vino haluse hawahali, suwe chasulumizwa kwachausa cho ubanasi wawo.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Chalongozwa ni watumwa, hahana ywa kuchikombola kulawa mwe nguvu zawo.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Chapata nkande kwa kuwambaza ujima wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">kwaviya wakomi we chila hantu kwe zinkonde wonga wachikome.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Nkanda zetu zaka moto saviya tanuli kwachausa cha sala ikuchoka.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Wavyele wetu wakankaliswa chinguvu mo mzi wa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:11">wachiche wetu wawadamanyiza unyakwili mwe vijiji vya Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Vilongozi wetu wagwilwa na kunyulikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:12">wakale wetu hawenkwigwe ntunyo yoyose.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Wabwanga wakunkuswa kusila mpuluzi kwa mayuwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">wanachilume wayunga yunga na mazilo ya nkuni.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Wadalahala waleka kulavya ulangilizi wawo kwe nchili yo mzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:14">wabwanga waleka kuchema na kutowa vimpwandwa vya nchemo.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Mbwedo mwe myoyo yetu haumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:15">hantu hakwe chinyulu chitendesa, elo hackuvina vituhu.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Seuta nachikefenyeza hahali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:16">Nachiluwone kwaviya chikola masa.<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Kwachausa icho chogula mwe myoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">kwa mbuli izo meso yetu yengila luzuyu.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Kwaviya lugulu lwa Sayuni lwasigwa bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">vigwema vyajenda mlanga mwakwe.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Mna weye Zumbe Chohile walongoza kale na kale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">ulongozi wako wekala vyeleko vyose hehene udumo.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Kwambwani kuchasa mazuwa yalozize?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">Kwambwani kuchijala seivyo mazuwa yalozize?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Chivuze kwako mwenye, weye Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">naswi chikuwiye, chivuzize ntunyo yetu saviya chikale.<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />Hegu kuchilemela ulo na ulo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:22">Togola kuchihiwa vitendese?<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>